Task 2: Online Pharmacy Inventory System
Objective
Build a Spring Boot application using Spring Data JPA to manage medicine inventory using Or and
Between finder methods.
Database Table: Medicine
medicineId - Long
medicineName - String
category - String
manufacturer - String
price - Double
stockQuantity - Integer
expiryDate - LocalDate
rating - Double
Insert Sample Data
Insert at least 10 medicine records into the database.
Repository Interface
MedicineRepository extends JpaRepository<Medicine, Long>
findByCategoryOrManufacturer(String category, String manufacturer);
findByPriceBetween(Double minPrice, Double maxPrice);
findByStockQuantityBetween(Integer minStock, Integer maxStock);
findByMedicineNameOrCategory(String medicineName, String category);
findByExpiryDateBetween(LocalDate startDate, LocalDate endDate);
findByRatingBetween(Double minRating, Double maxRating);
findByManufacturerOrCategory(String manufacturer, String category);
findByMedicineIdBetween(Long startId, Long endId);
CommandLineRunner Operations
1. Antibiotic or ABC Pharma.
2. Price 100-500.
3. Stock 50-200.
4. Paracetamol or Pain Relief.
5. Expiry 2026-06-01 to 2026-12-31.
6. Rating 4.0-5.0.
7. HealthCare Ltd or Vitamin.
8. IDs 201-210